01:57:23,960 --> 01:57:24,960
No one else is buying them.

425
01:57:25,380 --> 01:57:25,720
All right.

426
01:57:26,780 --> 01:57:27,800
And then you go and buy them.

427
01:57:28,620 --> 01:57:32,800
Right? So essentially if there is an overreaction to bad news

