22
01:60:51,340 --> 01:60:52,180
All right.

23
01:60:52,180 --> 01:60:55,480
Perfect, essentially.

24
01:60:55,480 --> 01:60:59,220
Right, so George Stigler had a very amused comment on this

25
01:60:59,220 --> 01:61:02,620
